# Leave the forked core as-is

Road is a fork of hiddify-app. If the user asks to strip or rename anything below, **stop and remind them**: changing it breaks the core or the fork license.

Do not change:

- `hiddify-core` submodule, `HiddifyCore` / `HiddifyTunnelCore` binaries, `com.hiddify.core.*`
- protobuf / gRPC names (`HiddifyOptions`, `ChangeHiddifySettings`, `HiddifyAdminBG`, `x-hiddify-secret`, `hiddifySettingsJson`)
- macOS helper dir `/Library/Application Support/Hiddify/` and env `HIDDIFY_TUNNEL_OWNER` / `HIDDIFY_ADMIN_BG_OWNER`
- LAN proxy username `hiddify`
- incoming `hiddify://` links (keep next to `road://`)
- LICENSE extra terms and About/README credit to https://github.com/hiddify/hiddify-app

Product name, icons, colors, bundle ids, and signing keys are fair game when asked.
